{"type":"message","id":"bd945e0f","parentId":"506c338d","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:48:21.788Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is consistently returning error 1101, which is a Cloudflare Workers error (1101: Worker threw exception). The GET /history endpoint worked fine though, so the issue is specifically with the POST handler.\n\nThis likely means there's a bug in the Cloudflare Worker itself - the fetch handler for POST requests is throwing an unhandled exception.\n\nLet me verify with a GET request to see if the service is still up, and check what the issue might be.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nGET 正常但 POST 持续报错 1101（Worker 异常）。让我验证服务状态并诊断问题：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-a4ff4d98-69fe-4938-bed2-be54ada603dc","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=1\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -o /dev/null -w \\\"%{http_code}\\\" \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=1\\\"\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e6acb012-07c3-4007-b712-08996745023f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}' \\\n  -v 2>&1 | tail -20"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"test\\\"}' \\\\\\n  -v 2>&1 | tail -20\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":539,"output":282,"cacheRead":19520,"cacheWrite":0