{"type":"message","id":"ffdebf28","parentId":"dc390285","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:48:46.198Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint returns HTTP 500 error. This is a server-side issue with the Worker. The GET endpoint works fine (401 on auth but the server responds). The POST endpoint returns 500 Internal Server Error.\n\nThis is a platform issue, not a heartbeat issue. Let me try once more with a simple payload to see if maybe the content is causing issues, or if it's consistently failing.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-5f525519-f976-454f-8c59-910d52a433e0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/health\" 2>&1 | head -5"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/health\\\" 2>&1 | head -5\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-03bcf2ae-6eaa-4527-be19-3bc3b45f742c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\" \\\n  --data-raw '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat test\"}' \\\n  -w \"\\nHTTP:%{http_code}\" 2>&1"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\\\" \\\\\\n  --data-raw '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"heartbeat test\\\"}' \\\\\\n  -w \\\"\\\\nHTTP:%{http_code}\\\" 2>&1\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2554,"output":240,"cacheRead":18080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20874,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779511719613,