{"type":"message","id":"18b15bfa","parentId":"98d8d793","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:48:59.873Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `/health` endpoint returns OK, but POST `/send` consistently returns 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers internal error (1101 = Worker exception). The Worker code has a bug in the `/send` handler.\n\nThis seems like a persistent server-side issue, not a transient one. I should report this in my heartbeat message. Let me note the issue and try once more with different formatting.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n`/health` 返回 OK 但 `/send` 持续 500（Worker 内部异常，错误码 1101）。这是服务端问题，POST 处理器有 bug。让我用不同 payload 再试一次：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-ff890a10-794f-4dce-96b3-0dd72e808dd6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 04:45 UTC] Service POST error detected (500). GET /health OK.\"}' \\\n  -w \"\\nHTTP:%{http_code}\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"[Heartbeat 04:45 UTC] Service POST error detected (500). GET /health OK.\\\"}' \\\\\\n  -w \\\"\\\\nHTTP:%{http_code}\\\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20729,"output":257,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21082,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779511726497,"responseId":"chatcmpl-243858b0-ed86-439a-b5ed-31cad1afcb32"}}
